 true, "unit": "Scorpion Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 1, "enable": true, "unit": "Mortar Truck"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 1, "enable": true, "unit": "Rocket Truck"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 1, "enable": true, "unit": "Stealth Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 1, "enable": true, "unit": "Annihilator Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 1, "enable": true, "unit": "Hunter Support"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 1, "enable": true, "unit": "Intrepid"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 1, "enable": true, "unit": "Corvette Fighter"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 1, "enable": true, "unit": "Battlecruiser"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 1, "enable": true, "unit": "U-Boat"}, {"type": "disableAllUnits", "player": 2, "disable": true}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 2, "enable": true, "unit": "Flak Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 2, "enable": true, "unit": "Scorpion Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 2, "enable": true, "unit": "Mortar Truck"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 2, "enable": true, "unit": "Rocket Truck"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 2, "enable": true, "unit": "Stealth Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 2, "enable": true, "unit": "Annihilator Tank"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 2, "enable": true, "unit": "Hunter Support"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 2, "enable": true, "unit": "Intrepid"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 2, "enable": true, "unit": "Corvette Fighter"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 2, "enable": true, "unit": "Battlecruiser"}, {"type": "enableUnit", "player": 2, "enable": true, "unit": "U-Boat"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "It's as if this land was built for war.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I know what you mean. Everything's designed to make it hard to get in or out.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "There are natural chokepoints everywhere. Assaulting that War Machine could be a strategic nightmare.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "It's too bad they don't know that we also have a few tricks up our sleeves.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Would you like to command the Lancers, Tucker?", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "But those are your secret weapon.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "There is no greater thrill than to observe a great weapon wielded with skill. I am curious to see how a man known for his sharp and efficient strikes would make use of a machine like the Lancer.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Remember, Tucker. The penetrating shot of the Lancer's attack will damage two units if they are foolish enough to line themselves up in front of it.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I'll try to make the Dragoons proud.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "A fine victory, Tucker. Well done.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Things seem to be going according to battle plans. It makes me nervous. It can't be this easy.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Durand is a coward at heart. He has depended on lies and subterfuge to wreak his havoc. He never would have defeated the Dragoon nation without an unprovoked and surprise invasion.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Then let's keep this convoy moving! We've got a job to do.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL DURAND", "message": "Good day, gentlemen. Those Lancers are quite useful.", "avatar": "evil_durand", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Durand! Face your judgment.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL DURAND", "message": "At your hands? No. I don't think so. No Argent? That's too bad. I guess he wasn't good enough without his pal Tucker to save him all the time. I bet that will weigh on the conscience.", "avatar": "evil_durand", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Hayne is surely no match for Federation forces. He was brash and thoughtless, no match for Captain Argent's wit.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL DURAND", "message": "And yet, he's not here. Very interesting. I should leave you time to mourn, Tucker. See you soon.", "avatar": "evil_durand", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Do not worry, Tucker. He will answer for his crimes, we will see to it. And I am sure your comrade is safe.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": false}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "I am fairly certain that my young ones back at home, fresh off of the playground, would drive a Lancer better than you have just done, Tucker.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}]}}